@startuml wave004_ota_ab_state
title State machine — A/B OTA slots
state "Slot A active" as A
state "Slot B active" as B
state "Recovery mode" as R

[*] --> A
A --> B : stage + boot success
B --> A : rollback / manual rollback
A --> R : both slots unbootable
B --> R : both slots unbootable
R --> A : repair_metadata + verified slot

note right of R
  userspace recovery only
  not hardware recovery partition
end note

@enduml
